1
00:00:04,448 --> 00:00:06,448
Gun, I go back to pack my things.

2
00:00:52,198 --> 00:00:55,354
Earth… are you really going?

3
00:01:02,034 --> 00:01:02,840
Yes.

4
00:01:03,356 --> 00:01:08,010
Then… take this with you.

5
00:01:09,001 --> 00:01:12,439
If you get lonely, you can hug it.

6
00:01:14,179 --> 00:01:16,179
Can you not go?

7
00:01:20,897 --> 00:01:22,897
Night is waiting for me.

8
00:01:24,203 --> 00:01:26,203
I'm going now.
